{"v":4,"catch":"緊急情況！\n你的命令是打敗危險的種子！","desc":"《DANGEROUS SEED》是 NAMCO 於 1989 年發行的射擊遊戲。\n你駕駛由α-Ship、β-Ship和γ-Ship組成的“Moon Diver”戰鬥機，與神秘的外星人[代號：Danger Seed]作戰。\n如果你可以讓你的所有船隻在戰鬥中運行，它們也可以組合併轉變為最終配置。\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2022-02-17","genres":["射擊","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/881dbde107e1d4dfbcae617d853337ec3aabebf964b40193b49c4ee24f1bb3d8.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/86871eb798947896508c75bb19d5a8ca61039f601452cceb043d8cee94d53813.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a9bb465776dadadf4221dab932ce94ce1a1fd7ca803614bf5d2ee02311d94fad.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/b03ffff5578c4645095c6fee75a73ebfc0afbc23b10f167e5f4cb74cbf1bb7c0.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/671d9a8a33cdf01da444dfd4ed4289cd1a57f319c9fa4e6268b16305c8a301d4.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/452571c405ce5e1970ce6b35a56d8ac0e67ad0a9ba8cdfa6f5b9d421223d9906.jpg"],"titleId":"010072401733c000","dlc":[]}